# Nghiệm Thu Redesign — Walkthrough

## Changes Made

### Backend ([workforceService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts))
- **[createSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts#107-142)** — No longer auto-marks tasks as `paid`. Tasks stay `unpaid` until user explicitly marks the settlement as "Đã thanh toán"
- **[deleteSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts#161-181)** — Rollbacks all linked tasks to `unpaid`, deletes link records, then deletes settlement
- **[updateSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts#143-160)** — When status transitions to `paid`, marks all linked tasks as `payment_status: 'paid'`

### Hook ([useWorkforceState.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/hooks/useWorkforceState.ts))
- Added task state refresh after [handleUpdateSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/hooks/useWorkforceState.ts#174-188) (when status changes) and [handleDeleteSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/hooks/useWorkforceState.ts#189-201)

### UI ([SettlementManager.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/components/SettlementManager.tsx)) — Complete Rewrite
3 views replacing the old single-view component:

**List View** — Summary cards (Total, Paid, Unpaid, Amount) + settlement cards with click-to-detail

**Detail View** — Full task table with all columns (#, Task, Client, Project, Closed Date, Price, Currency, VNĐ Equiv, Bonus, Bonus Note, Notes). Action bar with status workflow, PDF export, delete

**Create View** — Worker/period selection, task selection with price/bonus preview, breadcrumb hierarchy, VNĐ conversion preview

### PDF Export
In-browser `window.open` + `print` with professional layout: header, metadata, full task table, totals, signature areas

